---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Standby Generator Guide privacy policy: contact messages, hosting logs, current analytics and advertising status, and your choices.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: 2026-10-10. This is a plain-language policy, not legal advice.</p>
    <div class="prose-hgg mt-6">
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> if you email us, we receive your address and message content to respond.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> no analytics tracking script is currently enabled. The site has no accounts or logins.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Plans saved in your browser</h2>
      <p>The sizing, fuel, ownership-cost, and quote planners use your browser's local storage only when you choose <strong>Save</strong>. These saved inputs stay in that browser and are not sent to Standby Generator Guide. They remain until you use the planner's delete-saved-plan action or clear this site's browser data. On a shared device, anyone with access to the same browser profile may be able to load them. Avoid entering sensitive personal information. Blocking browser storage prevents saving, but the planners can still calculate with your current inputs.</p>
      <h2>Cookies & advertising</h2>
      <p><strong>Current status:</strong> no advertising script is enabled on the site today. We do not sell homeowner information or installation leads.</p>
      <p>If Google AdSense or another programmatic advertising service is enabled, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies, local storage, IP address, device/browser information, and ad-interaction data to deliver, measure, limit, or personalize advertising as permitted by your consent choices and applicable law. Programmatic ads are operationally separate from our editorial decisions and cannot buy favorable coverage, rankings, or product recommendations.</p>
      <p>For more information about how Google uses information from sites that use its services, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="external noopener noreferrer">Google's partner-sites privacy information</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="external noopener noreferrer">Google's advertising technologies information</a>.</p>
      <p>Before serving Google ads to users in the EEA, United Kingdom, or Switzerland, we will implement a Google-certified consent-management platform integrated with the IAB Transparency and Consent Framework, as required by Google's policies. Advertising remains disabled until the required consent controls and disclosures are in place.</p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>No live affiliate links are currently displayed, and we do not receive generator-brand, dealer, or installer referral fees. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">funding disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Static hosting on Cloudflare processes standard edge/server logs to deliver pages. We run no databases and no user accounts.</p>
      <p>If advertising is enabled, Google AdSense and its approved advertising partners may process information as described above. The specific vendors and consent choices available to you may vary by region and will be presented through the applicable privacy or consent controls.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use any consent or privacy controls presented on the site when advertising is enabled.</li>
        <li>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings; core editorial content remains readable.</li>
        <li>Review Google's ad settings and privacy information for controls that may apply to Google-served advertising.</li>
        <li>Contact us to request correction or deletion of a message you sent.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Content targets adult homeowners. We do not knowingly collect children's data and do not use interest-based targeting for children.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: see our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
